WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.200
[Orchestral music builds]

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.680
Man, I hate school.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:20.980
I wish we could learn things
that would be more relevant.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.140
I know, right?

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.040
With CASH’s plan, we’ll improve
the modern American school system.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.090
We will use current taxpayer dollars
on improving the quality

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.560
and accessibility of schools
across the nation.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:34.910
What about health care?

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:37.860
How will we make health care
more affordable and accessible

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:40.400
if we spend all our taxes on education?

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.660
We plan on making health care more accessible
by reducing the cost

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:46.300
of prescription drugs
and expanding telehealth.

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.960
What will happen to our taxes?

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.120
We believe taxes should be distributed fairly.

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:55.430
We will implement this
by creating a voting system

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.250
to determine what citizens want
their tax money to be spent on,

00:00:58.250 --> 00:00:59.600
and put an end to tax avoidance.

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:01.280
What will happen to the economy?

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:04.190
The economy will improve.

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:06.220
We will focus on employment,
American business,

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:08.700
affordability, and responsible spending.

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:11.080
Why should I waste my vote on CASH?

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:13.900
What makes Hannah different
from other candidates?

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.850
Our plan uses unique solutions

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:19.100
that don’t create problems for other sectors.

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.520
Every vote matters.

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:23.520
A vote for CASH means no crash!

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:25.080
Vote for CASH!

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:26.080
A vote for CASH!

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:27.540
A vote for CASH!

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:29.560
A vote for CASH means no crash!

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.000
[Orchestral music swells]

00:02:01.650 --> 00:02:04.000
[Music fades]
